{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Agent 8085 is a mining AI deployed to asteroid 8085 Pinsky. It builds mines, refines materials, and constructs systems to fulfill human contracts. Manage everything through a piping system that simulates fluid mechanics \u2014 in near-zero gravity, conveyor belts just wouldn\u2019t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By earning Neural Cores, it unlocks upgrades and improves operations, balancing energy and production to keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players decide Agent 8085\u2019s path: help humanity achieve unity, accelerate their destruction, prioritize profit efficiently, or simply follow orders without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing yet engaging sci-fi experience where mining, management, and decisions come together. Just make sure you have enough energy and optimize your production chain.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757130?t=1751061441","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757130/9a26974cbfbd60875757bd4a4cc02afb48dba494/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751061441","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757130/4f3104bb4fd233aabd6aad522e7ce6e6a80fd8c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751061441","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757130/4f3104bb4fd233aabd6aad522e7ce6e6a80fd8c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751061441","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Agent 8085 is a mining AI deployed to asteroid 8085 Pinsky. It builds mines, refines materials, and constructs systems to fulfill human contracts. Manage everything through a piping system that simulates fluid mechanics \u2014 in near-zero gravity, conveyor belts just wouldn\u2019t work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By earning Neural Cores, it unlocks upgrades and improves operations, balancing energy and production to keep everything running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players decide Agent 8085\u2019s path: help humanity achieve unity, accelerate their destruction, prioritize profit efficiently, or simply follow orders without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing yet engaging sci-fi experience where mining, management, and decisions come together. Just make sure you have enough energy and optimize your production chain.</p>","developers":["Colmillo Estelar"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757130/2393f3d3360273b32a5ef7276720038fc9d316df/header.jpg?t=1751061441","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All artwork, including but not limited to designs, models, textures, and visual assets, used in this game are the property of their respective artists and are protected under copyright laws. Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or use of these materials without proper permission is prohibited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161983,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161983/movie480.mp4?t=1750959151","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161983/movie_max.mp4?t=1750959151"},"name":"TrailerDeco","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161983/e97567580a641303e1ed41d41ce194fe4e4ef973/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750959151","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store